    "turn_text": "Well, Senator Fallon, I want to thank you so much for joining me today on this podcast. Thank you, Rob. Oh, absolutely, absolutely. Now, if you would, for those that don't know, if you would tell our listeners a little bit about yourself, who you represent and above all, what a Texas state senator actually does.",
