    "turn_text": "The last part of your question, a lot of people are still wondering. But I represent Senate District 30. I have the deep honor. In fact, it's the greatest honor in my professional and political life to represent nearly a million people. And Senate District 30 is comprised of 14 counties, parts of which are column 10 and then all 12 counties, which are Grayson, Cook, Montague, Wise, Parker, Jack, young, Archer, Clay, Pelop, you got the Watchtower County.",
