    "turn_text": "Uh, now good to kind of give you a backstory real quick. Um, Lauren was the, uh, girlfriend of my wife's nephew. I got to meet Lauren or we both did at a swimming party at his I'm not going to mention his name but out of respect but at his grandparents home sweetest girl sweetest girl I've ever seen I mean at 13 years old she was just live in life. She loved life. Now her parents, Verna Bianca, we've become really, really good friends over the years. And from talking with them, you kind of touched on it earlier about their involvement, it gathered that they were pretty instrumental in helping you with the bill. Can you tell me what it was like working with them and what I can only say must have been a very difficult time for any parent? And can you kind of let me know what it was like working with them?",
