    "turn_text": "No, thank you. But, you know, that goes right back. They were the ones that inspired us. We're the ones that have left, you know, them, not the other way around. And for, you know, with this technology that we have today, you really need to leverage it as a legislator. And I try to give people active updates. Sometimes, you know, people that are directly involved, you know, might have also be attacked. I mean, I can be on the Senate floor during a debate with another member and can, you know, while the other member has a microphone, grab the phone and give them a little text.",
