    "turn_text": "Life is still precious. How can we let someone in that closet, not even out of anger or passion or, you know, peppery and sanity in the moment, that's manslaughter. worse because you're still, I mean, that's just as nearly as bad. I mean, our life has taken, life has taken. But when you have coldly and rationally clocked to rob another's life and that you will be eligible for parole, the worst we can choose is 30 years. That doesn't add up to me.",
